{
  "name": "boa",
  "_about": "SCULPTED (2026-11-21, tools/creaturegen/rework/herps/snakes.py): the BOA CONSTRICTOR, 2.5 m and 11 cm thick, the tail a tenth of it; a head clearly wider than the slim neck, long, the snout squared off, small eyes with vertical pupils; a dark stripe down the middle of the crown, a dark wedge from the snout through the eye to the jaw; pale buff with dark brown SADDLES down the back, broad at the spine and waisted, that turn REDDISH toward the tail and maroon edged cream on it; dark lozenges with pale middles along the flanks; a cream belly. Coats: common (red-tailed), Hog Island (pale, orange tail), Argentine (dark).",
